## ⚙️ Example Code

```pinescript id="8mz2qp"
//@version=5
indicator("Sum of Four Candles", overlay=false)

sumFour = close + close[1] + close[2] + close[3]

plot(sumFour, title="Sum of 4 Candles")
```

